  "description": "Povitrulya Fujiyama, Japanese landscape. Counted Cross Stitch Kit for Home Decor, 28х18 cm - Distributed/Packaged by Povitrulya. Product Details: 🗻Embroidery kit \"Fujiyama\"features an image based on a Japanese hand painted postcard from the early 1900s. It refers to \"Thirty-six Views of Mount Fuji\", a famous series of landscape prints by the outstanding Japanese ukiyo-e artist Katsushika Hokusai.✌️ The finished embroidery can be used for home decor in a living room, dining room, bedroom, in an office, hotel, bar or restaurant. Perfect as a housewarming gift or a surprise for a loved person. The embroidery process develops fine motor skills, has a positive effect on your nervous system, and the resulting design will delight you with its beauty!👌 Partly stitched: this cross stitch kit does not require you to work the entire background. This way, the embroidery doesn't take much time and the piece you get is just gorgeous.☝️ The embroidery pattern for this cross stitch kit has been created by a certified specialist and put to the test by being stitched before printing!❗ Our DIY embroidery kits include just enough thread colors to ensure a bright and quality design. You won’t have to stitch any redundant \"single\" crosses. Every stitch is exactly where it belongs.✂️ Cross stitch kit details:▫️ Size: 11.02\" х 7.09\" (28 cm х 18 cm);▫️ Colors: 9;▫️ General characteristics: full cross stitch in two strands, full cross stitch in one strand, stem stitch;▫️ Canvas color: white.✂️ This embroidery kit includes:▫️ Color pattern;▫️ 16 count Aida fabric (100% cotton);▫️ Mouline threads (100% cotton);▫️ Metal needle.Thank you for visiting our Amazon store!Povitrulya",
